*** PRELUDE
*** C6c-standing-prelude — the plain binary has NAT/BOOL via the standing prelude (fable-audit.md §3.4).
*** Marker added when the C6c fix landed: post-flip the harness runs marker'd fixtures on the standing
*** prelude — exactly what this fixture pins — and markerless ones with -no-prelude.
reduce in NAT : 2 + 2 .
reduce in BOOL : true and false .
